%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral', 'sequence': {'boxMargin': 10, 'messageMargin': 40, 'noteMargin': 15, 'bottomMarginAdj': 15}} }%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant N as nginx :8080
    participant S as settingsmanager :9000

    B->>N: GET /
    N-->>B: static/index.html

    rect rgb(234, 245, 244)
    Note over B,N: Phase 1 — submit config
    B->>N: POST /config/update  (ServiceConfig, protobuf)
    N->>S: proxy_pass POST /config/update
    Note right of S: register transaction as "received"
    S-->>N: 200 Confirmation{status: received}
    N-->>B: 200 Confirmation{status: received}
    end

    Note right of S: after 5s, transaction<br/>transitions to "applied"

    loop poll while status == "received"
        B->>N: GET /config/confirmations/{transactionId}
        N->>S: proxy_pass GET /config/confirmations/{transactionId}
        S-->>N: 200 Confirmation{status}
        N-->>B: 200 Confirmation{status}
    end

    Note over B,N: last poll returns status: applied — polling stops
